Package: pxweb2rgui
Title: Data From PxWeb API v1 and v2 With a Graphical Interface and RStudio Addin
Version: 0.21.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Peter", "Möller", , "larspetermoller@gmail.com", role = "aut"),
    person("Christian", "Lindell", , "christian_lindell@yahoo.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
  )
Description: pxweb2r and pxweb2rgui in one package. Tools for fetching data
    and metadata from a PxWeb API v1 or v2, by default Statistics Sweden's
    statistical database. Other providers, such as Statistics Norway and
    Statistics Denmark (which has an API of its own), and every language a provider offers can be used. Handles automatic chunking
    of large requests, label values in queries, wildcards, "latest period",
    aggregations, and splitting DeSO and RegSO by municipality. Results are
    returned as tidy tibbles. A Shiny interface, also available as an RStudio
    addin, lets the user choose provider, language, table, variables and
    values, and gives ready-made pxr_pxweb2_get_data() code. Data can be
    downloaded as txt, Excel or parquet.
